{"3739720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Obscuris", "steam_appid": 3739720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cooperative horror experience where survival depends on meeting deadly quotas… or facing what lurks in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 6 players as Japanese high school girls exploring a modern-day Japan filled with unsettling locations and terrifying creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night, you must venture into different areas—some featuring procedurally generated interiors—to collect enough Obscure and meet the required quotas. Exploration, risk management, and teamwork are key: players must coordinate, decide how far to push their run, and escape before dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on tension, unpredictability, and cooperative survival. Encounters with monsters are dangerous and can happen at any time, forcing players to adapt quickly and react under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can equip magical abilities to help them survive their runs, and a small skill tree allows progression and improvements over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer sessions are designed for high replayability, with multiple maps, randomized elements, and evolving situations in each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can also customize their character with dozens of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story mode is not yet available, and the game is still in active development. For more details about current features and future content, please refer to the Early Access section.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cooperative horror experience where survival depends on meeting deadly quotas… or facing what lurks in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 6 players as Japanese high school girls exploring a modern-day Japan filled with unsettling locations and terrifying creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night, you must venture into different areas—some featuring procedurally generated interiors—to collect enough Obscure and meet the required quotas. Exploration, risk management, and teamwork are key: players must coordinate, decide how far to push their run, and escape before dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on tension, unpredictability, and cooperative survival. Encounters with monsters are dangerous and can happen at any time, forcing players to adapt quickly and react under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can equip magical abilities to help them survive their runs, and a small skill tree allows progression and improvements over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer sessions are designed for high replayability, with multiple maps, randomized elements, and evolving situations in each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can also customize their character with dozens of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story mode is not yet available, and the game is still in active development. For more details about current features and future content, please refer to the Early Access section.</p>", "short_description": "Co-op horror for 1–6 players set in modern Japan. Play as Japanese high school girls, explore eerie locations (some procedurally generated), collect Obscure at night, meet deadly quotas, and escape before dawn. Customize your character. Story mode not yet available.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Russian, Italian, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739720/9c3afd6dc506d5df3ef80f6ff350bb56cc289a3c/header.jpg?t=1786959482", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739720/73b8657dda6d4ccf9c643069274a322d937f5418/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786959482", "capsule_imagev5": "https: